  unitNumber: 28
  description: A dragon rider from the ruined Sama Kingdom. He trained under his
    father and became a dragon rider at the young age of 14. His ability to ride
    marine and aerial dragons made him a promising candidate for commander. He was
    deeply loyal and accepted orders from his king unconditionally, but that inflexibility
    eventually led to his downfall.
  summonDesc: You want to know why <br>dragon riders wield spears?<br>Let me show
    you!
  fusionDesc: I want my power back.<br>I wonder, will I ever return <br>to my former
    self?
